    "title": "Enel EFI · historical sustainability-linked coupon test",
    "question": "What cash coupon could the documented ratchet add, and which conditions remain unproven?",
    "scope": "Historical Enel Finance International N.V. EUR1,000m initial0% notes XS2066706818 due June17 2024; guarantor/KPI Enel S.p.A. under the documented perimeter. Knowledge cutoff August3 2021; June30 KPI observation is not the December31 2021 target outcome. Source programme supplement, issuer financial-note/target disclosures and limited-assurance statement support a conditional pricing test; specific Final Terms/full contract package remain incomplete. Full-year coupon equivalents assume full original principal and an effective step-up; they are not actual accrued payments, net hedged funding cost, a spread forecast or issuer-level materiality. Unknown event/timing/access/market/outcome fields remain gaps. Actual current host with preflight context; no blind/independent/provider/native claim. All eight ESG analytical views remain. Excel is ingestion-only; no workbook output."
